  <summary>&lt;p>A Kwin script that truely maximizes your screen space by hiding the title bars of your windows when they are maximized. You can configure a blacklist from the script settings. There is also an optional screen edge listener to toggle it off/on (look in your screen edge listener settings).&lt;br />&lt;br />This is the Plasma 6 version. The Plasma 5 version can be found here: &lt;a href="https://www.pling.com/p/2018573/">https://www.pling.com/p/2018573/&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />Based on (but not forked from) bahamondev/hide-titles &lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/1354715">https://store.kde.org/p/1354715&lt;/a>&lt;/p></summary>
